/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/builtins.k-100-  rule maxVals(M:Int, (I:Int, R:Vals)) => maxVals(maxInt(M, I), R)
/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/builtins.k-101-
