/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/builtins.k:103:  rule applyBuiltin("min", I:Int, REST:Vals) => minVals(I, REST)
/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/builtins.k-104-  rule minVals(M:Int, .Vals)           => M
