/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/builtins.k-112-    => str(iCons(45, iCons(48, iCons(98, binCodes(0 -Int N)))))
/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/builtins.k-113-       requires N <Int 0
